### 1. Health Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create a New Enquiry (Triggers "pricing_question" SOP)
# @name createEnquiry
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "email",
  "customer_name": "Jane Doe",
  "message": "Hello, I would like to get a quote for a team of 10."
}

### 3. Get Enquiry History 
# Note: Replace {id} with the job_id returned from the previous request
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/{id}/history
Accept: application/json

### 4. Schedule a Follow-Up
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/{id}/follow-up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delay_minutes": 60,
  "message_template": "Just checking in on the pricing we sent over."
}

### 5. Manual Escalation
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/{id}/escalate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer is requesting a custom enterprise tier."
}